 "result": "Call order at the end of a request:\n\n1. `Tessel.wsgi_entry` → `dispatch` (`src/tessel/app.py`): the view runs and returns `rv`.\n2. `Tessel.finalize_request` (`src/tessel/app.py:1021`): calls `make_response(rv)` (`app.py:1224`), then `finalize_reply`.\n3. `Tessel.finalize_reply` (`src/tessel/app.py:1394`): runs the after-request functions, then, if `not session_interface.is_null_session(ctx._get_session())`, calls `session_interface.persist_session(self, session, response)` (`app.py:1415-1416`).\n4. `SignedCookieSessionInterface.persist_session` (`src/tessel/sessions.py:337`): serializes and signs the session, then calls `response.delete_cookie(...)` (`sessions.py:356`) if the session is empty, or `response.set_cookie(...)` (`sessions.py:374`) otherwise.\n\n`ctx._get_session()` (`src/tessel/ctx.py:~387`) lazily loads the session through `session_interface`. The abstract `persist_session` is at `sessions.py:263`.\n\nI didn't read `sessions.py:337-374` in full, so the branch conditions inside `persist_session` come from the grep hits, not a line-by-line read.",
